              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Abiya wamxosha uJerobowamu, wathatha kuye imizi: iBethele namadlelo ayo, neJeshana namagxamesi ayo, ne-Efrayin namadlelo ayo.",
          "type": "text",
